#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/usb.md:10
msgid "USB control and CDC composition"
msgstr "USB 控制与 CDC 装配"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/usb.md:12
msgid ""
"These helpers compose explicit control requests, descriptors, CDC traffic "
"and role changes over selected USB faces. They do not discover hardware, "
"authorize VBUS wiring or create a scheduler."
msgstr "这些辅助机制在选定 USB 接口上组合显式控制请求、描述符、CDC 流量和角色切换，不发现硬件、不授权 VBUS 接线，也不创建调度器。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/usb.md:16
msgid "Public declarations"
msgstr "公共声明"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/usb.md:18
msgid "usb_acm.h"
msgstr "usb_acm.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/usb.md:20
msgid "Optional caller-owned CDC ACM control subset."
msgstr "由调用者拥有存储的可选 CDC ACM 控制子集。"

